diff --git a/package/uefi/K70DiagnosticsPkg/Library/DxeLogSerialPortLib/UPSTREAM.md b/package/uefi/K70DiagnosticsPkg/Library/DxeLogSerialPortLib/UPSTREAM.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..855f01f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/package/uefi/K70DiagnosticsPkg/Library/DxeLogSerialPortLib/UPSTREAM.md
@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+The renderer is copied without changes from the locally pinned UEFI tree:
+
+- Repository: https://github.com/yyx2025/uefi-vermeer
+- Commit: `ae57e93f0eb6b556f1bb964ffb12f0e78aaaf33c`
+- Directory: `Silicon/Silicium/SiliciumPkg/Library/FrameBufferSerialPortLib`
+- `FrameBufferSerialPortLib.c` is stored as `FrameBufferSerialPortLib.original.inc`.
+- `Font.h` and `FrameBuffer.h` retain their original names.
+- The upstream root license is copied in `LICENSE.upstream`; its copyright
+  notices, conditions, and disclaimer apply to the copied files. The copied C
+  file itself has no additional license header.
+
+SHA-256 of the copied bytes:
+
+| File | SHA-256 |
+| --- | --- |
+| FrameBufferSerialPortLib.original.inc | `07d3b7034159420a074947ccb38db235b95202d9928ed79e367ee770505be61a` |
+| FrameBuffer.h | `556f0ba7479eda4d0ecfe3a6b01c83ba3cfbfe60338e26d0aeeb8645d615993f` |
+| Font.h | `d2a3687db67b069f4e34a961e17fd28b0242986e3fa8dd8a7545cab70834fa8e` |
+| LICENSE.upstream | `2b031880c646006165194888f9814806719ab4c91c26d330c4eb71e1983f0187` |
+
+`DxeLogSerialPortLib.c` macro-renames only the copied renderer's
+`SerialPortWrite`, then supplies the public function that appends to the shared
+configuration-table log before invoking that renderer. All other SerialPortLib
+functions and rendering code remain the copied implementation. There is no
+per-image ring storage. Writes before table installation are screen-only.
+
+Integration must select this instance only for DXE_DRIVER,
+DXE_RUNTIME_DRIVER, UEFI_DRIVER and UEFI_APPLICATION modules, while keeping the
+original framebuffer instance for SEC, PEI and DXE_CORE. Its own constructor
+saves the supplied SystemTable pointer; there is no gST external symbol or
+UefiBootServicesTableLib dependency. Before construction it remains screen-only.
+Compiler atomics and `-mno-outline-atomics` avoid a SynchronizationLib dependency
+in this serial implementation. The package directory must be in `PACKAGES_PATH`
+as `K70DiagnosticsPkg`. The ring driver and other consumers using the default
+header hooks still map `SynchronizationLib` to
+`MdePkg/Library/BaseSynchronizationLib/BaseSynchronizationLib.inf`.
+Ensure the existing DXE DebugLib actually routes DEBUG to SerialPortLib and
+that any per-component SerialPortLib overrides (especially ArmCpuDxe) select
+this instance. The ring driver should dispatch early. A 64-KiB allocation is
+accepted only inside MemoryMapLib's exact `DXE Heap` descriptor; failure has no
+fixed-address fallback. The platform memory map still needs separate checking
+against the matching OEM `uefiplat.cfg` before hardware use.
+
+The table is boot-services-only. It is neither a USB transport nor a persistent
+crash log, and it does not collect SEC/PEI or XNU output after ExitBootServices.
